(6135049, 904140, 104009, '<td valign="top">can''t get the oxymoron here.  odd choice of shot.  the small bit of blue on the left is distracting.  5  ETA thanks for the explanation, makes me feel a little dopey that i missed something as simple as "plastic glass" and well, i DO consider myself a little intelligent honestly i SHOULD have gotten "black light"  i''m disappointed in myself and disappointed i only gave this a 5 obviously more thought was put into it than i gave you credit for, even though i''ve been spending time on each shot i''m going to move forward taking a little more time to see what i might be missing</td>', 'can''t get the oxymoron here.  odd choice of shot.  the small bit of blue on the left is distracting.  5  ETA thanks for the explanation, makes me feel a little dopey that i missed something as simple as "plastic glass" and well, i DO consider myself a little intelligent honestly i SHOULD have gotten "black light"  i''m disappointed in myself and disappointed i only gave this a 5 obviously more thought was put into it than i gave you credit for, even though i''ve been spending time on each shot i''m going to move forward taking a little more time to see what i might be missing', '2010-08-19 08:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
