(6135632, 903916, 120160, '<td valign="top">Great shot on capturing the details on the squirrel. Like the way he is gazing back. Unfortunately, I feel that the shot''s concept is rather drifted from the ''oxymoron'' theme. This would have been a great shot had it been submitted for something wildlife related.</td>', 'Great shot on capturing the details on the squirrel. Like the way he is gazing back. Unfortunately, I feel that the shot''s concept is rather drifted from the ''oxymoron'' theme. This would have been a great shot had it been submitted for something wildlife related.', '2010-08-19 22:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6135638, 904122, 120160, '<td valign="top">I love this shot! The shadow from the lighting position set it up to be the perfect illusion. I wonder how many times did you retried, picking most of the paper on the floor. Kuddos! A well deserved 10!</td>', 'I love this shot! The shadow from the lighting position set it up to be the perfect illusion. I wonder how many times did you retried, picking most of the paper on the floor. Kuddos! A well deserved 10!', '2010-08-19 22:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6135639, 903389, 120160, '<td valign="top">Hey, we submit the same title... Great men thinks alike! =p<br/> <br/>Fantastic shot! You even manage to get the branches of the lightning! <br/>Your shot reminds me of Batman, Gotham City. Almost expecting the batman sign to be casted upon the clouds.. A 10 for the great shot!</td>', 'Hey, we submit the same title... Great men thinks alike! =p Fantastic shot! You even manage to get the branches of the lightning! Your shot reminds me of Batman, Gotham City. Almost expecting the batman sign to be casted upon the clouds.. A 10 for the great shot!', '2010-08-19 22:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
