(6135976, 904084, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''d never heard of watery oil before, and I didn''t remember it on the oxymoron list. But I just looked up the term and found it multiple places. The fun this is, when I did a search for "watery oil" in google (including the quotation marks", your picture showed up as #4 in the google results!<br/> <br/>Anyway, very cool image -- nicely done! (not voting)</td>', 'I''d never heard of watery oil before, and I didn''t remember it on the oxymoron list. But I just looked up the term and found it multiple places. The fun this is, when I did a search for "watery oil" in google (including the quotation marks", your picture showed up as #4 in the google results! Anyway, very cool image -- nicely done! (not voting)', '2010-08-20 09:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
