(6140295, 903551, 108580, '<td valign="top">Thanks all for the comments and votes including Inspector Grog :) The plane had just taken off (as you can see by the nose wheel bays still closing) and going like a bat out of hell. Very difficult to shoot sharply with a 500mm f/6.3 (effective 750mm on a 1.5x crop factor DX)<br/><a href="//www.flickr.com/photos/magnum_za/4896694807/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Here is another shot of it</a> about 60 seconds later and traveling even faster.<br/>Is it a toy plane indeed! You''re right to question it, as in photography anything is possible...</td>', 'Thanks all for the comments and votes including Inspector Grog :) The plane had just taken off (as you can see by the nose wheel bays still closing) and going like a bat out of hell. Very difficult to shoot sharply with a 500mm f/6.3 (effective 750mm on a 1.5x crop factor DX)Here is another shot of it about 60 seconds later and traveling even faster.Is it a toy plane indeed! You''re right to question it, as in photography anything is possible...', '2010-08-25 03:13:01.000000', NULL, 0),
