(6140637, 904102, 120355, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Magnum_za:</b></div><hr/><i> Well Done.<br/>But you got 8 x 2, 5 x 3 and 15 x 4 Voters for the "tsk tsk OMG it''s a Gun who gives a ---- for the photography" crowd :(<br/>PS: You left out a description of the most important prop ;) Looks like a DA 9mm but which one, there are thousands. Either that or its a MIC Toy. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Actually, that is a Ruger .40S&amp;W, the P91DC, to be precise. Not only is it my favorite, its the most accurate I own. Just to clarify. =D</td>', 'Originally posted by Magnum_za: Well Done.But you got 8 x 2, 5 x 3 and 15 x 4 Voters for the "tsk tsk OMG it''s a Gun who gives a ---- for the photography" crowd :(PS: You left out a description of the most important prop ;) Looks like a DA 9mm but which one, there are thousands. Either that or its a MIC Toy.   Actually, that is a Ruger .40S&W, the P91DC, to be precise. Not only is it my favorite, its the most accurate I own. Just to clarify. =D', '2010-08-25 11:17:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(6140648, 903984, 77991, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by acg83:</b></div><hr/><i> Good idea and pretty well executed with the DoF.<br/> <br/>If you could have gotten rid of the brown haired woman with the glasses in front so your subject wasn''t so hidden, it would have been an top shot. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>LOL.  Yea, that would have been nice! Next time I''ll tell the people in the crowd where to go. ;)  I took about 100 pics that evening and this is about the only where the person was looking into the camera.</td>', 'Originally posted by acg83: Good idea and pretty well executed with the DoF. If you could have gotten rid of the brown haired woman with the glasses in front so your subject wasn''t so hidden, it would have been an top shot.   LOL.  Yea, that would have been nice! Next time I''ll tell the people in the crowd where to go. ;)  I took about 100 pics that evening and this is about the only where the person was looking into the camera.', '2010-08-25 11:21:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(6140659, 903864, 103142, '<td valign="top">Loved this shot!! Congrats on a great blue! (I don''t even know how any could see the "hair"! I had to look quite awhile to see what you''re talking about :)</td>', 'Loved this shot!! Congrats on a great blue! (I don''t even know how any could see the "hair"! I had to look quite awhile to see what you''re talking about :)', '2010-08-25 11:24:17.000000', NULL, 0),
