(6141545, 904102, 55822, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by citymars:</b></div><hr/><i> Ducky, cigarettes, and a gun -- I''ll bet you really pushed some buttons with this one.  Interesting to have her ring on her middle finger, too.  Btw, I like the shallow DOF but it does seem a waste not to be able to see more of your model. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I love her already, btw Leroy very nice shot. I''m partial to .45''s myself.</td>', 'Originally posted by citymars: Ducky, cigarettes, and a gun -- I''ll bet you really pushed some buttons with this one.  Interesting to have her ring on her middle finger, too.  Btw, I like the shallow DOF but it does seem a waste not to be able to see more of your model.   I love her already, btw Leroy very nice shot. I''m partial to .45''s myself.', '2010-08-26 02:25:27.000000', NULL, 0),
